        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Organizations: Human Events, Texas Department of Transportation\n- People: Thomas S. Winter\n- Products: Texas Highways\n\nFacts:\n- Human Events was founded in 1944 as a print newspaper.\n- Texas Highways is a monthly magazine published by the Texas Department of Transportation.\n- Texas Department of Transportation states that Texas Highways promotes travel and tourism to Texas through articles and photography.\n- Human Events became a digital-only publication in 2013.\n- Thomas S. Winter serves as the president and editor-in-chief of Human Events.",
